  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DDG/MAG global landmine initiative 2015-2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DDG/MAG global mininsats 2015-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict-affected populations are supported by promoting a safe and secure environment conducive to stability and recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian mine action in South Sudan, Iraq, Myanmar and Libya. Implementing partners are Danish Refugee Council/DRC and Mines Advisory Group/MAG.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen omfattar arbete inom minhantering/mine action (r&#xf6;jning av minor och oexploderad ammunition samt begr&#xe4;nsning av effekten av dessa) i Sydsudan, Irak, Myanmar och Libyen. Insatsen genomf&#xf6;rs av Danish Refugee Council/DRC (genom dess minhanteringsenhet Danish Demining Group/DDG) och brittiska Mines Advisory Group/MAG.</narrative>
  </description>
